If you’ve been wanting to start a business but keep getting stuck on _where_ to begin, this is for you…

The HelpBnk Starter Kit gives you** the tools plus a mentorship session with someone from Simon's network** to get your business off the ground.

But there’s been so much demand that we simply can’t take everyone at the moment. 

So instead of a simple waitlist, we’re opening a short application form and will hand‑pick the people we believe are most likely to _actually_ launch and grow a business with our help. 

**If you’re accepted, you can also get:**

* A free website for 1 year

* Business bank account and accounting sorted

* Weekly seminar calls from Simon Squibb's Network

* Access to our private community & accelerator content...

If you want in, add your name to the waitlist here:

👉 [APPLY FOR YOUR STARTER KIT](https://www.simonsquibb.com/starter-kit?utm_source=newsletter-hb)

This isn’t about being “perfect” or already successful. We’re looking for people who are committed, willing to take action, and ready to use the Starter Kit properly.

HelpBnk


———

