Working from home is cheap…

It’s also where the washing machine, the dishwasher and every other job you’ve been avoiding are waiting for you.

**So we’ve got something awesome for you David!**

Tradestars is giving the HelpBnk community **two months free** at its Islington coworking space.

They have day passes, hot desks and fixed desks. All memberships come with free access to the gym at Tradestars Islington (we don't know another workspace provider that offers this!)

You also get private booths for calls, showers, a cafe area, breakout spaces and access to the Tradestars app.

Use code **TRADESTARS2FREE** when you join.

👉 **[Claim your two months free](https://book.tradestars.space/offerings/category/memberships)**

— HelpBnk

**P.S.** Only need a space for a few hours? Tradestars also has meeting rooms, podcast studios and photography studios in Islington, Southwark and Hackney Wick. **[Book one here](https://book.tradestars.space/offerings/tradestars-meeting-rooms)**.


———

