Email from ChadTough Defeat DIPG Foundation Remembering Michael As We Approach His 18th Birthday On August 27, Michael would have celebrated his 18th birthday.﻿ ﻿ While Michael's life was far too short, his legacy continues to change the future for children and families facing DIPG through: More breakthroughs. More families supported. More reasons for hope.﻿ ﻿ To commemorate this special milestone, we're launching our 18 for 18 Campaign. In honor of Michael's 18th birthday, we're inviting you to make a monthly or one-time gift of $18, $180, or $1,800 (or any amount meaningful to you), or simply share a birthday tribute in Michael's honor. Every way you participate helps continue the legacy Michael inspires. Become a Monthly Supporter Make a One-Time Gift Write a Tribute to Michael Because of Friends Like You﻿ ﻿ ChadTough Defeat DIPG has invested more than $48 million in research around the world while providing one-on-one nurse navigation to nearly 700 families facing DIPG/DMG. Every breakthrough, every family served, and every step forward is possible because people like you continue to believe that together, we can Defeat DIPG. As we honor Michael's 18th birthday, thank you for helping ensure his legacy continues to create hope for every child and family facing DIPG. Join the 18 for 18 Campaign today. Thank you for celebrating Michael's life by investing in hope for the next generation of children facing DIPG. With gratitude, Ann Friedholm, CEO           ChadTough Defeat DIPG Foundation | PO Box 907 | Saline, MI 48176 US Unsubscribe | Constant Contact Data Notice<!DOCTYPE HTML>
