Hi Dave,

Tomorrow, on August 5 at 10 AM IST, hundreds of QA engineers will be building AI-powered testing workflows live. If you're planning to join the event, now's the time to reserve your spot. Every participant gets access to a live browser sandbox, seats are limited and registration closes once capacity is reached.

In just 2 hours, you'll leave with:

• A working AI-powered testing workflow you built yourself
• An AI Implementation Blueprint you can take back to your team
• An extended product trial to keep experimenting after the session
• Entry into a $1,500 hackathon, with 48 hours to build, mentor support, and the chance to showcase your solution

If you've been planning to register, don't wait until the last minute. Once the browser sandbox reaches capacity, we won't be able to open additional live seats.
Secure My Spot (https://www.browserstack.com/webinars/aixtesting-bootcamp-hackathon-apac?utm_source=livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=DevRel%20Event-05-Aug-2026-AI-X-Testing-boot-camp-APAC&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000vwZmBYAU&utm_term=APAC_Fomo)

Can't make it live? Register anyway, every registrant gets the AI Implementation Blueprint and session recording

Best,
The BrowserStack Team



