adl D.C.'s July top 5


ADL D.C.'s Top 5 is your monthly snapshot of what matters most, bringing you the five biggest things happening at ADL and in our regional community. From major moments in our fight against antisemitism and hate to timely resources, local updates, and ways to take action, we&rsquo;ll keep you informed, connected, and ready to make an impact in a quick read you can count on each month.


