The Rising Political Force With an Antisemitism Problem: DSA Backgrounder


 &zwnj; 
 


https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29DhTudLmsPyJVSJmGAOupQgySah4qtPesHn2o5DZx-aruorNSuQu-DTn49UqlXS8L6Kh1tYMif4lJoHJmOzaZ4dR0O-pvIiw 


 &zwnj; 
 


The Democratic Socialists of America (DSA) is a rapidly rising force in American politics, and as its influence has grown, so has the reach of its extremism, putting Jewish Americans directly in the crosshairs. Inside the organization, anti-Zionism isn't just tolerated, it's a litmus test for belonging, all while DSA leaders have openly celebrated terrorist attacks against Jews. This isn't some fringe group: it's a movement with real power, and its rhetoric and agenda are carrying real consequences.

In May 2026, ADL Washington, D.C. teamed up for a community briefing with our partners at AJC Washington, D.C. and Greater Washington JCRC to examine Metro DC DSA's impact on our region. ADL wants to keep you and your circles informed. That's why this month, ADL Center on Extremism released the latest backgrounder and share it with someone who needs to see it. 
https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29EdXsPkAHWB4JaOI_EcKVZEUcVAxGjixoOblLwNc2z4yc5XOe667vlcy5ywgu-BPxyPG-DlD2W1iMJl6O89W0XAIn5q_eUyA 
Click here to get started. 


 &zwnj; 
 


 &zwnj; 
 

different faiths, shared purpose


 &zwnj; 
 


 &zwnj; 
 


Meaningful interfaith partnerships help build and sustain trust, strengthen our communities and create powerful opportunities to stand together in the fight against hate. Our traditions may look different, but our hearts are pointed in the same direction: toward dignity, safety and peace for all people. That shared purpose is what gives us so much hope for the future.

https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29FfcXy1-zhcGkeKkO7qwoOr-RU0b5Me94yegqg1sEtkkx29iKCyCjp24gdejwlQVnY6TyG9_xlH3ElVngddcin9wDCaNMlpQ 
This month, ADL Washington, D.C. Deputy Regional Director Josh Stevens was proud to represent ADL D.C. at the American Muslim & Multifaith Women&rsquo;s Empowerment Council (AMMWEC) conference  at the National Press Club. Thank you to American Muslim & Multifaith Women's Empowerment Council, Anila Ali, Archbishop Atallah Hanna, and all who made this important gathering possible.


 &zwnj; 
 


 &zwnj; 
 

Maryland Man Sentenced for Attempting to Provide Material Support to ISIS


 &zwnj; 
 


https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29GmGUaz5OtZ0eIC_W7FAjW3V_uZY0IJeMHoAxC5FzgLfu28vFxAqJ6TE_w5UM0M66BGJykBfx5Mt4JuDuRs5Fq6f9XS7Hq5g 


 &zwnj; 
 



https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29H_t8n8er6SGGc_XoQZ7exJMoIqnWxeHGr1yrCzOLoJGqJ2RPbLRjRuX58VS6UuRkKdvy77aA7mJaVaLp2Suf1w0rHlzfD8g 
A Maryland man plotted to join and fight for ISIS . His "plan B" was to "gun down" Jews and people in the U.S. he believes support Israel. This month, he was sentenced to 15 years in prison. This is not an isolated case. ADL has documented 13 terrorist plots targeting Jews in just the past two years. The threat is real, rising and it demands our full attention. Thank you to the FBI and law enforcement for thwarting this plot. ADL Center on Extremism tracks every terrorist plot and attack targeting Jews in the US.
https://click.adlmail.org/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5NTR9AAEAAAAAAVRlU29IcpofP2ygEMkMQ5jwM8JrpZVVXq8jB9wEsv8GqpUyVvgmJKDlbaB3dOgMjW-Y-S_u_dv7auIX7zg

