    Recruit Morgan State Students for Part-Time & Flexible Employment!
Registration is now open for Morgan State University's 2026 On-Campus & Part-Time Job Fair, a free recruiting event designed to connect employers with talented Morgan State students seeking part-time, seasonal, temporary, volunteer, and other flexible employment opportunities. 
📅 Date: Thursday, September 3, 2026🕚 Time: 11:00 a.m. – 1:00 p.m.📍 Location: University Student Center Patio (Outdoor Event)
Eligible Opportunities

Part-time employment
Seasonal positions
Temporary positions
Volunteer opportunities
Flexible work opportunities

Why Participate?

Connect with talented Morgan State students ready to work
Promote your organization and available positions
Recruit for immediate and upcoming hiring needs
Build your talent pipeline early in the academic year

Participation Guidelines

This event is intended for organizations recruiting students for part-time, seasonal, temporary, volunteer, or other flexible employment opportunities.
Organizations recruiting exclusively or primarily for internships or full-time career opportunities are encouraged to register for Morgan State University's Fall Career & Internship Fair, taking place on September 30, 2026.
Organizations recruiting exclusively for commission-only positions are not eligible to participate.

Register Today

Employer registration is free but required through Handshake. 
To maximize visibility and student engagement, participating employers are encouraged to post their available opportunities in Handshake before the event.

Reserve your free spot today!
We look forward to welcoming you to Morgan State University and connecting you with exceptional student talent.
  



 

  

    
      
        Register for On-Campus & Part-Time Job Fair
      
    
  



 


   
  
    
  
