          This week at the winery
          Comedy, fresh bites, and bottles worth grabbing.
          Your weekly Virginia Beach Winery lineup: Matthew May’s expanded menu, live-stock wines, and two easy ways to make this weekend more fun.
        

        
          
            
            
              Fresh this week
              Matthew May added more to the menu.
              Matthew is making fresh boards for the cooler Thursday, then he’ll be here Friday night through comedy night. Order ahead for Friday or Saturday, or grab anything showing in stock while we’re open.
              CharcuterieBeer cheese &amp; pretzelGrilled cheesePimento cheese &amp; crackersInfusion kits
              Order Matthew May →
            
          

          
            Coming upTwo great reasons to make a winery stop.
            
              
                Friday, July 31 · 8 PM–10 PMLive Stand-Up ComedyNext Stop Comedy brings a touring stand-up lineup to the winery. Seating begins at 7:30 PM; general admission is $27.View event details&nbsp;Get comedy tickets →
                Sunday, August 2 · 1:30 PM–3 PMPaint Your PotsPaint two ceramic pots and choose two succulents with Inspired Canvasses. It’s $30 per person, with supplies and good vibes included.View event details&nbsp;Reserve your spot →
              
            
          

          
            Pouring nowLive Square inventory, ready when you are.These bottles are currently showing in stock. Order online from vbwinery.com or stop in for a tasting.
            
              Recently back · 12 in stockWinter BluesSweet grape wine with natural blueberry flavor.Order / view wine →
              20 in stock · $21Beach BlackberryOur perennial best seller with natural blackberry flavor.Order / view wine →
              28 in stock · $22MalbecA deep red Chilean Malbec with a smooth, heavy oak finish.Order / view wine →
              39 in stock · $21ZinfandelA semi-sweet rosé inspired by Maria’s bisnonna, Grazia.Order / view wine →
            
            See the full wine shelf →Inventory is live from Square and can change quickly.
          

          Bring the winery with you.Events, rewards, quests, wine updates, and quick links live in the Virginia Beach Winery app.Download on the App Store
        

        Virginia Beach Winery
1064 Lynnhaven Pkwy #110, Virginia Beach, VA 23452
