2027 ETC CONFERENCE INFO



Help Shape the ETC 2027 Conference
What topics should ETC be talking about in 2027?
The ETC 2027 Conference Planning Committee is looking for your ideas to help build a conference program that reflects the real challenges and opportunities facing our industry. Whether you have a fully developed session idea or simply know the conversations we need to be having, we want to hear from you. 

Your ideas will help ensure the conference is timely, relevant, and valuable for our community.

We're looking for:
The biggest challenges your organization expects to face over the next two to three yearsUp to three conference session ideasRecommendations for speakers or moderators (including yourself or colleagues)
Proposal Deadline:August 15, 2026

2027 CONFERENCE SESSION IDEAS


This email was sent on behalf of Educational Travel Consortium located at 27 NE 55th Ave, Portland, OR, 97213.To unsubscribe click here. If you have questions or comments concerning this email contact Educational Travel Consortium at etc@educationaltravelconsortium.com.



