Good morning!
It's not too late to get the word out for 2026 or too early to plan for 2027!  Let's start planning brochure and travel guide distribution! Displays fill up quickly!

The last few years have been the busiest travel years we've seen! We have seen an increase in brochure and travel distribution and anticipate the trend to continue. There are so many great drivable destinations! Let us help capture the travelers and tourist's attention and promote your destination. Travelers are opting in when picking up brochures and travel guides!

Ask me about the PA Turnpike Program! There are 17 PA Turnpike plazas that would love to have your brochures! Pick one or pick all! Pricing starts at just $30 per month per plaza for a 4x9 brochure! According to the Turnpike Commission, more than 500,000 people use the roadway daily. This is sure to get your business noticed. People pick up brochures not only for immediate use but for planning!

Ask me about the Maryland and Chesapeake House I 95 Travel Plaza programs! Combined with the Delaware Welcome Center, these are the three busiest plazas on I95! All 3 plazas for $750 for the year!

I have attached a brief overview of our programs in the MidAtlantic area and am happy to send more detailed information for your review. Please let me know how I can help.

Kelly



Kelly Tragis
Account Executive
Getaways On Display, Inc
147 Arrowhead Drive Bldg 3
Manheim, PA 17545
Phone Number  717-653-8070 ext. 207


www.GetawaysOnDisplay.com<http://www.getawaysondisplay.com/>
We Inspire Travel and Deliver Visitors!

