Today We Celebrate More Than Tequila.

We celebrate its heritage.

Every bottle of AsomBroso begins long before it reaches your glass.

It begins in the volcanic soils of Jalisco. In the blue Weber agave that pa=
tiently matures beneath the Mexican sun. In the hands of artisans whose kno=
wledge has been passed from one generation to the next.

For centuries, tequila has represented far more than a spirit. It is a refl=
ection of Mexico's culture, craftsmanship, and unwavering pursuit of excell=
ence.

At the House of AsomBroso, we are honored to continue that tradition=E2=80=
=94crafting tequilas that respect the past while embracing the future.

Today, on National Tequila Day, we invite you to raise a glass in celebrati=
on of the extraordinary people, places, and traditions that make every bott=
le possible.

Whether you enjoy the vibrant purity of=C2=A0El Platino Silver, the signatu=
re elegance of=C2=A0Eros Reposado, or one of our meticulously aged Extra A=
=C3=B1ejo expressions, today is a day to appreciate not only what's in the =
bottle=E2=80=94but everything that came before it.

An Invitation to Celebrate
As a member of the AsomBroso Society, we invite you to celebrate National T=
equila Day with us. As a token of our appreciation, enjoy=C2=A015% savings=
=C2=A0on your online order for the next 24 hours using code=C2=A0TEQUILA15.

Use Code: TEQUILA15

Because appreciation should be shared with those who have supported our jou=
rney.

Offer Ends Tomorrow =C2=A0at 11:59 PM (PT).

=E2=80=8B

=E2=80=8B

Thank You

Your support allows us to continue doing what we believe matters most:

Creating tequila without compromise.

Respecting the traditions that define authentic craftsmanship.

And sharing the spirit of Mexico with those who appreciate the extraordinar=
y.

From all of us at the=C2=A0House of AsomBroso,

Happy National Tequila Day.

=E2=80=8B

The House of AsomBroso

"Respect Tradition. Embrace Innovation. Pursue Excellence."

