If you're having trouble viewing this email, you can see it online, https://api.neonemails.com/emails/content/egnJGd69WX0UzAKC56EOfWdTjgtgCW7lbOVMYlFXHr0=.
Hi Friends,

It's me, Leah, again. I'm so excited that my favorite weekend of the year is finally here!

We have just a few spots left for tonight's Welcome Dinner at The Festival Center, and I'd love to see you there if you can make it. Doors open at 6:30pm. It's always one of the most special evenings of the weekend.

Reserve Your Seat for Tonight Here!

Then tomorrow, we can't wait to welcome everyone to the Festival at The Festival Center and to the Museum of the Palestinian People for our Open House. We've been working so hard to make this weekend beautiful, and I can't wait to share it with you all.

If you haven't reserved your spot yet, now's the time, we'd love to celebrate with you.

RSVP for Saturday Here!

And as always, if cost is a barrier, please reply to this email, and I'm happy to help. 

See you this weekend!

With you, always, 

Leah

And a huge thank you to our sponsors as this Festival would not be possible without them: 

Palestinian American Medical Association 

Falafel Inc. 

Kanoon

Al Ard 

Anera



 



Support MPP Monthly



 



Follow Our Instagram

