Dear Friend, 

 

If you've been waiting for the perfect moment to become a member of the MPP's Resilience Monthly Club, your moment has come! Visit the RMC table at our annual cultural Festival this Saturday - Rooted in Resistance: Here Eternally, and receive a free gift (while supplies last) for signing up or for upgrading your membership.

 

🌸Learn more about the Resilience Monthly Club🌸

 

Starting at $35/mo, you become a sustaining partner whose reliable support helps to ensure that Palestinian history, art, culture, and storytelling continue to thrive in the heart of Washington, DC.

 

As a Resilience Monthly Club member, you'll also enjoy meaningful benefits, including:

Quarterly newsletter with exclusive content

Unlimited Museum admission

Discounts in the Museum Gift Shop

Invitations to exclusive member events and exhibition tours

Early access to ticketed programs

Recognition as a vital member of our community

Additional perks at higher giving levels

 

Join/upgrade at our Festival, and you'll receive a special gift as our thank you for becoming a recurring supporter.

 

Book Your Festival Tickets for Saturday

 

Monthly giving is one of the most powerful ways to sustain the Museum's mission. Whether you give at the Key Level or beyond, your commitment creates a dependable foundation that allows us to boldly plan upcoming events, programs, and exhibitions.

We are grateful for your support of the Palestinian people through our efforts to share Palestinian stories, art, history, and culture.

 

Join the Resilience Monthly Club

 

We are so excited to see you at the Festival this weekend!

 

With gratitude,

Mariam Y. Mehter

Director of Development, MPP





 



Join the RMC



 



Follow Our Instagram

