A memorable holiday celebration is rarely built around just one moment.

It begins when guests arrive and gather over cocktails. It continues around the table through dinner, speeches, and awards. And when the formalities are over, the best celebrations give everyone a reason to stay.

At National Union Building, each part of your event can have its own setting without asking your guests to leave the venue.

INQUIRE NOW (https://corsaircreative.tripleseat.com/party_request/22896)

Welcome Guests with

a Cocktail Reception

Start the evening in a space designed for conversation, drinks, and easy arrivals. A dedicated reception area allows guests to settle in before the main celebration begins.
https://www.nationalunionbuildingdc.com/host-your-event?utm_source=email

Bring Everyone Together for Dinner and Awards

Move into a separate room for dinner, presentations, and recognition. With distinct event spaces throughout the building, your program can feel polished and intentional rather than confined to a single setup.
https://www.nationalunionbuildingdc.com/host-your-event?utm_source=email

End the Night with a Celebration

After dinner, invite guests to another floor for music, dancing, cocktails, or a hidden speakeasy experience. Each transition gives the evening new energy while keeping everything conveniently under one roof.
https://www.nationalunionbuildingdc.com/host-your-event?utm_source=email

From intimate team dinners to company-wide celebrations, National Union Building offers the flexibility to design an event around the way your guests will actually experience it.
https://corsaircreative.tripleseat.com/party_request/22896

