Hi Dave,

Is your team stuck running AI pilots that never make it past the prompt stage?

You spend hours fixing tests that break with every UI change, only to watch toolchain integration drain the time your engineers should be spending on release velocity.

Instead of chasing more tools, you need an ecosystem that turns AI into measurable outcomes. Join Siddhant Wadhwani, SDET Manager & Head - AI COE, Newfold Digital, and Sudipta Patra, Product Manager - AI Labs, BrowserStack, to see how AI use cases move from prompts to production, with real ROI to show for it.

Date & Time: July 28, 2026 at 3:30 PM IST
Reserve My Spot (https://luma.com/browse-m88b)

In this session, you will learn:
* How self-healing AI cuts build failures by 40%, even as your UI keeps changing.
* Ways to write tests in plain English with natural language agents, speeding up test creation by up to 10x.
* Methods to connect fragmented AI testing tools into one ecosystem with measurable, trackable ROI.

Stop running AI pilots and start shipping production-grade testing outcomes.

[Register to attend] (https://luma.com/browse-m88b)

Best Regards,

BrowserStack Events

