Your brain isn't meant to remember everything.

Where you saved that business idea. What you decided in last week's meeting. The login details for that account you set up three months ago. That article you wanted to read later.

Most people try to hold all of this in their head, or scattered across fifteen different apps, and wonder why they feel constantly overwhelmed.

**Here's what actually happens:**

You have a brilliant idea at 11pm. Write it in your phone's notes app. Wake up the next day, it's buried under seventeen other random thoughts and you never see it again.

You start a project, create a Google Doc for planning, a Trello board for tasks, an Excel sheet for tracking, and now you've got three places to check and none of them talk to each other.

It's exhausting. And it's costing you more than you think.

**We run HelpBnk entirely in Notion.**

Everything actually lives in one place and we can find it when we need it.

Project plans connect to tasks. Meeting notes link to the people involved. Random ideas get captured and organized instead of lost forever.

It's basically a second brain that doesn't forget things or lose them in fifteen different apps.

And because it's been such a game-changer for us, we've been bugging Notion for ages to get something for our community.

They've agreed to give **SIX MONTHS** of their premium plan.

**Half A Year.** Normally worth $12K if you're a startup. You get it for nothing.

**To redeem your free 6 month plan, click here and sign up with your company email (no @****[gmail.com](https://gmail.com)**** etc):**

[Redeem your 6-month free Notion plan here](https://ntn.so/helpbnkhvs)

It's first come, first served and we couldn't think of a better launchpad for your business, don't miss out.

**HelpBnk Team**


———

