I came across your website and wanted to ask a quick question.

 

Have you looked into whether your business is being recommended by AI
platforms like ChatGPT, Google Gemini, or Claude when people search for
businesses like yours?

 

Many websites rank well on Google but still don't appear in AI-generated
recommendations. I've been helping businesses improve their visibility in AI
search, and I thought it might be worth checking for your website as well.

 

If you're interested, Let's discuss, please share your AI availability.

 

Thanks

