Dear Team,

 

I hope this message finds you well.

 

Following a recent editorial review, our Editorial Board has selected David
Saxe for an exclusive leadership feature in an upcoming global edition of
Timeiconic Magazine <https://timeiconic.com/magazines/> .

 

Cover Theme:
"Top 10 Architects of the Experience Economy in 2026"

 

This is not a standard media listing or promotional article. It is a
professionally produced executive profile created for a limited number of
leaders whose vision, innovation, and influence are shaping the future of
their industries.

 

Each feature is developed by our editorial, design, and branding teams to
create a lasting leadership asset that executives can leverage across
investor relations, corporate communications, media outreach, recruitment,
keynote engagements, and digital branding.

 

The feature includes:

. Exclusive Cover Story (Print & Digital Editions)
. Executive Leadership Profile with Professional Editorial Development
. Premium Magazine Design & Brand Presentation
. International Press Distribution
. Long-Term Digital Publication & SEO Visibility
. Corporate Branding & Promotional Campaigns
. Recognition Trophy, Certificate & Print Copies
. Ongoing Digital Archive & Executive Recognition

 

To maintain editorial quality and exclusivity, each edition is limited to
only 10 featured leaders worldwide, with participation confirmed on a
first-confirmed basis.

 

The standard editorial investment for this executive feature is $3,000. As
one of our personally selected leaders, you have been extended an exclusive
invitation rate of $2,500.

 

Should this opportunity be of interest, I would be delighted to share the
editorial timeline, interview questionnaire, recent editions, and complete
participation details.

 

Thank you for your time and consideration. We hope to have the privilege of
showcasing your leadership in this exclusive edition

 

Best Regards,


Annu Kumari
Business Development Manager


