https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_One_Day_To_Go_New_Email_2_APAC

Hi Dave,

In just 24 hours, QA Leadership Summit Summer 2026 begins. While many engineering teams are still experimenting with AI, the leaders are already taking AI from pilots to production. Join 20,000+ QA professionals to learn the practical strategies, governance frameworks, and implementation playbooks behind AI-first quality engineering.
Register For Summit (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_One_Day_To_Go_New_Email_2_APAC)

If you're still deciding, this is what you'll miss if you don't join tomorrow:
* Be the First to Experience BrowserStack's Latest AI Launch: Witness BrowserStack's newest AI capabilities designed to help teams create, execute, and scale testing faster and more reliably.
* Learn from Global QA Leaders: Hear practical implementation stories from engineering experts at Google, Salesforce, EPAM, Infosys, Ramco Systems, and other leading technology companies on building AI-first QA organizations.
* Hands-On Workshop: Learn AI-powered test generation with OpenAI Codex and master prompt engineering techniques to create accurate, production-ready test automation.
* Proven Frameworks for AI in Production: Discover practical approaches to building trustworthy AI systems, operationalizing AI across QA, and scaling automation with confidence.

This isn't another conversation about AI's potential. It's your front-row seat to how leading engineering teams are putting AI into production

[Secure Your Seat] (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_One_Day_To_Go_New_Email_2_APAC)

See you at the summit!

Happy Testing,

Adam Bernard

