Plus the **Doorbell of Dreams**: pitch your dream on the spot and we’ll send a personalised deck straight to your inbox.

Bring mates, bring your idea, bring neither. Just come.

[👉 Save My Spot](https://bolabeachtennis.as.me/schedule/51a04503/?appointmentTypeIds[]=95092579)

-HelpBnk

**P.S.** If your week’s been all screens and spreadsheets, two hours of sand and sunset is the reset. See you there.


