    FALL 2026 CAREER FAIR
  



 

  

    🤝 Meet Your Future Workforce and Recruit Bowie State Talent 🤝
The Engage Center for Experiential Learning and Career Readiness at Bowie State University is pleased to invite employers and community partners to participate in the Fall 2026 Career Fair on Wednesday, November 4, 2026, from 1:00pm to 4:00pm.
This event provides a valuable opportunity to connect with a diverse pool of talent, including first-year students exploring career pathways, upper-class undergraduates, graduate students, and alumni seeking internships, part-time, and full-time job employment opportunities.
Participating in this career fair allows your organization to:

Increase brand visibility on campus
Engage directly with motivated students and alumni
Strengthen your recruitment pipeline
Promote current and future employment and experiential learning opportunities

  




  

    
      
        
          
            
              
                
                Career Fair
              
              
                Fall 2026 Career Fair at Bowie State University
              
              
                November 4, 2026 • 1:00 pm - 4:00 pm EST
              
              
            
          
          
            
              
            
          
        
      
    
  



 

  

    📝 Registration Information
Registration Fee: $450.00 per organization, which includes 2 recruiters ($50.00 for each additional recruiter)
Registration Includes:

1 Draped Booth
2 Chairs
1 Organization Name Sign
On-Campus Parking
Lunch

  



 

  

    🔄 Registration Process
After submitting your career fair registration through Handshake, a staff member from the Engage Center will review your request. If approved, you will receive an email containing an invoice and confirmation of approval.
Once approved, you must log back into the Handshake system to pay for your registration by submitting a payment via credit card (preferred) or by mailing a check. Please note that registration is not considered complete until payment is received.
Online registration and payment must be completed by Friday, September 25, 2026.
Due to limited space, any payment not received by the deadline may result in a registration cancellation to accommodate employers and community partners on the waiting list.
  



 

  

    ⚖️ Registration Approval Policy
All registrations are subject to administrative review and approval at the discretion of Bowie State University, who reserves the right to approve registrations based on factors including, but not limited to:

Alignment with academic programs and majors
Industry representation and balance
Space limitations
Demonstrated student interest
Institutional priorities

Submission of a Registration Request does not guarantee approval, and your registration is not confirmed until official approval has been communicated by the BSU Engage Center.
  



 

  

    📞 Event Coordinator
Mrs. Dorothy WigglesworthAssistant Director of Employer Partnerships and Experiential OpportunitiesThe Engage Center for Experiential Learning and Career ReadinessBowie State University
✉️ dwigglesworth@bowiestate.edu📱 301-860-3831
  



 


   
  
    
  
