    University of Virginia - Join us in August!
  



 

  

    Greetings from UVA!
We invite you to join us for several employer engagement opportunities this August:
Virginia Universities Career FairAugust 13 | UVA Fairfax CampusConnect with students and alumni from UVA, Virginia Tech, George Mason, William & Mary, JMU, University of Richmond, and more. Register here.
UVA Fall Mock Interview Day (Free for employers)August 27 | 9:00 a.m.–4:00 p.m. | UVA Career Center, Bryant Hall, Scott StadiumHelp students prepare for recruiting season through mock interviews and resume feedback. Employers may offer behavioral, case, or technical interviews. Register here.
Resume Marathon (Free for employers)August 27 | 10:00 a.m.–2:00 p.m. | Newcomb Hall Ballroom, UVAProvide students with constructive feedback during 15–20 minute resume review sessions. Register here.
Fall 2026 Career FairsRegistration is now open for all UVA Fall 2026 recruiting events.
Thank you for your partnership. Please feel free to reach out with any questions about these events or our upcoming career fairs.
Best,
Paul----Paul Paparella, Ph.D.Associate Director, Employer RelationsUVA Career Centercfu9pu@virginia.edu | tel: 434-924-0603career.virginia.edu/
 
 
 
 
 
 
  



 

  

    
  



 


   
  
    
  
