Dear Friend, 

 

Our Resilience Monthly Club was launched in 2019 for a $19/mo commitment-  the MPP had just recently opened our doors in Washington, DC, and we came to rely on the regular support that helped us to plan ahead for exhibits, programs, and events.

Seven years later, we are deeply grateful for everyone who has been an RMC since our launch, and also to all those of you who joined for shorter stints at any point.

We have just updated our RMC giving levels to include more perks (stay tuned if you are already a member!), and invite you to join the RMC if you haven't already!

 

Join the Resilience Monthly Club!

 

Monthly membership fees help the MPP accommodate and offset costs associated with maintaining a larger space, incorporating more programming, platforming more Palestinian artists, and (ethically!) acquiring new pieces to share and put on view.

RMC members will have unlimited visits to the Museum, access to private tours/events, and discounts on gift shop items among other perks that will be outlined in a quarterly newsletter. 

 

We are so excited to revive our Membership program- we hope you will be a part of it!

 

Become an RMC Member

 

Thank you for your continued support of the Palestinian people through our efforts to share Palestinian stories, art, history, and culture.

 

With gratitude,

Mariam Y. Mehter

Director of Development, MPP





 



Join the RMC



 



Follow Our Instagram

