If you're having trouble viewing this email, you can see it online, https://api.neonemails.com/emails/content/7Q2q4wRutL1m7UkMnevubUybbx7XXaj7RVNfSuEwCGE=.
Dear Friend, 

 

Thank you for standing with the Museum of the Palestinian People and believing in the importance of Palestinian stories, history, art, and culture having a permanent home in Washington, DC.

This year marks a major turning point for the museum.

After years of building, dreaming, and welcoming visitors into a small but powerful space, we have now purchased and expanded the museum space. MPP is no longer temporary. We are here to stay.

Now comes the next important step.

We need to fill this newly acquired space with life.

That means new exhibitions. More Palestinian artists. More programs. More educational opportunities. More space for visitors to encounter Palestinians and hear our voices.

 

Join the Resilience Monthly Club

 

To help make this possible, we are reviving our Resilience Monthly Club, a community of monthly supporters who help sustain the museum not just for one event or one season, but for the future we are building together.

Our goal is to welcome 40 new monthly supporters in the next two weeks.

A monthly gift, at any level, gives the museum the steady foundation we need to plan ahead, care for the space, support programs, and keep our doors open to the public. It is one of the most meaningful ways to stand with MPP during this next chapter.

When you join the Resilience Monthly Club, you are helping sustain a permanent Palestinian cultural institution in the heart of Washington, DC.

You are helping make sure this space is not only built, but alive.

Please consider becoming one of the 40 new monthly supporters we are hoping to welcome over the next two weeks.

 

Become an RMC Member

 

If you are already an RMC member, thank you for your continued support of the Palestinian people through our efforts to share Palestinian stories, art, history, and culture.

 

With gratitude,

Bshara Nassar
Founder and Executive Director, MPP





 



Join the RMC



 



Follow Our Instagram

