https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_2_APAC_No_Prefilled_Old_Email

Hi Dave

You are exclusively invited to join senior QA and engineering leaders at QA Leadership Summit Summer 2026, where the industry's leading AI practitioners will reveal how they are taking AI initiatives from pilots to production.

Be among the first to witness BrowserStack's latest AI product launch, followed by expert sessions from Google, Salesforce, EPAM, Infosys, and more, sharing proven strategies for building AI-first QA organizations.
Register for QA Leadership Summit (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_2_APAC_No_Prefilled_Old_Email)

Here's a glimpse of what's coming:
* Leadership Talk: AI, Risk & the Future of QA
Nathan Harvey (Product Manager, Google) shares AI adoption trends, risk-based verification strategies, and how QA leaders are redefining quality in the age of AI.
* AI Governance in Action: Expert Panel
Maryna Didkovska (Senior Director, EPAM Systems) and Harleen Bedi (AVP, Infosys) discuss AI governance, safety guardrails, QA evaluation frameworks, and the critical role of human oversight in deploying trustworthy AI systems.
* Next-Gen Automation with AI: Live Workshop
Julio De Lima (Capco) - Master AI-powered test generation with OpenAI Codex and learn prompt engineering techniques for accurate, reliable, and production-ready automation.

Gain practical AI frameworks, hands-on workflows, and dive into interactive engagement challenges throughout the summit.

[Save Your Seat] (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_2_APAC_No_Prefilled_Old_Email)

Best Regards,

BrowserStack Events

