**HelpBnk Takeover @ Bola Beach Tennis**

🗓 Thursday 23rd July

🎾 All equipment provided. Zero skill required.

View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/cd76a7db-3ed3-4e05-96fe-958522310a8c/bola-sunset-social-2026.png?t=1783023566)
