    Fall 2026 Recruitment Season
  



 

  

    Dear Employer Partner,
Greetings from the Engage Center at Bowie State University!
We invite you to participate in Bowie State University’s Fall 2026 Recruitment Season (September–December 2026). This is an excellent opportunity to connect with BSU students and alumni while recruiting for internships, part-time and full-time positions, cooperative education experiences, and other experiential learning opportunities.
If you are interested in recruiting on campus, we offer several opportunities to engage with our students and alumni:
Employer Information Sessions
Employer Information Sessions are formal presentations that provide an opportunity to introduce students to your organization, share information about your culture and career opportunities, and discuss your recruitment process. Information Sessions are available on a limited basis and are scheduled upon approval of the Engage Center.
Employer Information Tables
Employer Information Tables offer an informal setting to promote your organization, discuss career opportunities, answer student questions, and increase your campus visibility. Information Tables are available on Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays thru out the semester.
On-Campus Interviews
On-Campus Interviews in a professional setting are designed to support your recruitment efforts. You may customize your interview schedule to meet your hiring needs, including candidate screening and prescreening options. The Engage Center will promote your campus visit through multiple communication channels to maximize student and alumni participation.
Career Fair, Save the Date – Fall 2026 Career Fair
We are pleased to announce that the Bowie State University Fall 2026 Career Fair will be held:
Wednesday, November 4, 2026
1:00 p.m. – 4:00 p.m.
Martin Luther King Jr. Center Building, First Floor
Bowie State University
Additional information including employer registration details will be shared soon
Posting, Jobs, internships, and Other Positions
Throughout the recruitment season, employers are encouraged to post employment and experiential learning opportunities through Handshake platform, Bowie State University's online career management platform.
Requesting Recruitment Services
Requests for Recruitment Events must be submitted through your Handshake employer account by selecting Events. Employers may also post job and internship opportunities and manage recruitment activities by selecting Jobs within Handshake. 
We appreciate your continued partnership and thank you for your commitment to providing valuable career opportunities for Bowie State University students and alumni.
If you have any questions, please contact me or the team in BSU Engage Center. We look forward to partnering with you during the Fall 2026 Recruitment Season.
Sincerely,
Engage Center for Experiential Learning and Career Readiness
