'==Hey ==David==!==

==We’re sure you’re busy (hopefully building towards your dream ==😉==)==

==But as a reminder, here's everything HelpBnk gives you for free, in one place:==

**The Starter Kit**
==£150 in your pocket, a mentorship session with someone from Simon's network, a free website for a year, and your bank account & accounting sorted - everything you need to go from idea to actual business.==
_[[Get the Starter Kit →]](https://www.simonsquibb.com/starter-kit-organic)_

**Free events, every single week**
==Live sessions with real founders and mentors - sales, pricing, finding your idea - plus in-person meetups from Brighton to Dubai. ==_[[See what's on →]](https://helpbnk.com/events)_

**The Free Ecommerce Launchpad**
==Everything you need to know to start selling products online. Over 5,000 founders learning, sharing wins, and helping each other build ecommerce brands. Free to join. ==_[[Join the Launchpad →]](https://helpbnk.com/spaces/free-ecommerce-launchpad)_

**The Dreamfund**
==Every month we give away 10% of our profits to dreamers. Pitch your dream in a 60-second video. If it's chosen, you get £5,000 plus mentoring to make it real. ==_[[Pitch your dream →]](https://www.simonsquibb.com/e3t/Ctc/ZZ+113/dkhChl04/VVn_Gg3h18xpW2tC0SJ1BSGWCW1m0cDV5Rsz_9N4gTlK23lYM-W6N1vHY6lZ3mrVvDMJj2rQLj3W2qL-8Z6NT_1wW396RYv7dwyPSW17TWc6689qBVW3jD32C4DYkDbW7yWWdm93M4k3W43Vrm_6CmjBJMVSnlww5sb7W2Cn9xB2BW2kzW3WzHB03JbNpTV8n1L66RX7C4W2753ZX2Cw27xW7dwZbv264_wnW6cSKcG83dMZ2W5txvbz85xzQqW3YXd9t7Tkx7mW7cMR2c612Y1fW4HPN_P23fK3hW6BFKgJ5884m1MmgsSp67KvKN4HLTs4J131TW7CbkgQ6lJhNBf378dJY04)_

==**Everything above is free, and it always will be.**==== HelpBnk exists so that money, or not knowing where to start, is never the reason a dream stays a dream.==

==Pick one thing from this list and do it today.==

==If i had to suggest one that is best fit for you, ==**I would say The **[**Starter Kit**](https://www.simonsquibb.com/starter-kit-organic)==[.](https://www.simonsquibb.com/starter-kit-organic)==

==Hope to see you soon!==

==Team Helpbnk==


