Dear Friend

We have a few spots left for Painting Memory, Ritual, and Palestine, led by Sarah Alsamarai, Wednesday, July 15 at 7:00 PM.



This hands-on painting workshop invites participants to explore Palestine, memory, identity, and diaspora through still life, creating a personal painted composition inspired by objects that carry stories of home, ritual, and belonging. 

No prior painting experience is needed, and all materials will be provided.

We'd love to see you there! 

Reserve Your Spot Now!

