Thank you for purchasing AppleCare+ with Theft and Loss.

This Proof of Coverage confirms AppleCare+ with Theft and Loss coverage for the referenced Apple product. You can also verify your coverage online at mysupport.apple.com/products.

First, let’s make sure you have Find My enabled on your device. You’ll need this because your Theft and Loss coverage requires you to have Find My on your iPhone at the time it is lost or stolen. Open the Settings app on your iPhone and tap your name. Then tap Find My and turn on Find My iPhone.

Learn more about how Find My affects your Theft and Loss coverage in the Find My section below. 

Take a moment to review your coverage details. If corrections are necessary or if you have questions, please contact Apple Support.
