SENIORS ON SENIORS
Managing the Heat: Expert Tips for Older Travellers (https://openjaw.com/newsroom/tourism/2026/07/09/coping-with-heat-expert-travel-tips-for-older-travellers/)
https://openjaw.com/newsroom/tourism/2026/07/09/coping-with-heat-expert-travel-tips-for-older-travellers/

Welcome to our series about ‘travelling while old’. It’s about the risks older travellers face when they leave for the airport and enter a world that’s different from when they were younger.

The authors know that world well. Bob Ramsay is a 77-year-old writer and adventure traveller who takes his increasingly older friends on trips to the ends of the earth. His wife is Dr. Jean Marmoreo, an 84-year old family physician who is now a MaID doctor and a High Arctic fly-in physician.

Their first column, no surprise, is about coping with extreme heat.

READ MORE (https://openjaw.com/newsroom/tourism/2026/07/09/coping-with-heat-expert-travel-tips-for-older-travellers/)

