https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=mailchimp-prefilled&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_1_APAC_New_Email_2&uid=ecf19809c8

Hi Dave

The teams redefining QA in 2026 aren't experimenting anymore. They are already in production, and here's what they're building next.

Be among the first to witness BrowserStack's latest AI product launch, followed by expert sessions from Google, EPAM, Salesforce, and Infosys as they share practical strategies for building AI-first QA organizations - from pilots to production.
Register for QA Leadership Summit (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=mailchimp-prefilled&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_1_APAC_New_Email_2&uid=ecf19809c8)

Here's a preview of what you'll learn:
* AI Governance in Action: Expert Panel - Maryna Didkovska (Senior Director, EPAM) and Harleen Bedi (AVP, Infosys) discuss AI governance, safety guardrails, QA evaluation frameworks, and the role of human oversight.
* Leadership Talk: AI, Risk & the Future of QA - Nathan Harvey (Product Manager, Google Cloud) shares AI adoption trends, risk-based verification strategies, and how QA leadership is evolving in the AI era.
* Next-Gen Automation with AI: Live Workshop - Julio De Lima (Capco) demonstrates how to use Playwright MCP and LLM CLI for AI-powered test generation, smarter maintenance, and scalable automation.

Walk away with practical insights, live demos, and proven AI QA playbooks

Save Your Seat (https://www.browserstack.com/events/qa-leadership-summit-summer-2026?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=mailchimp-prefilled&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=QALS-summer-july-2026&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rLyu1YAC&utm_term=QALS_Email_1_APAC_New_Email_2&uid=ecf19809c8)

Best Regards,
Adam Bernard

