Caption: 

**🏆 The June Ambassador Award (£500) goes to… Gina from Nudum Skincare**

Gina worked in early years education.

Kid after kid with eczema. Cream after cream that did nothing.

The industry's answer? More chemicals.

So she made her own.

Handmade, organic, grass-fed tallow skincare. No parabens. No sulfates. No nonsense.

A year ago it was an idea. Now it's a proper brand - full product range, real customers, real skin transformations in the reviews.

She didn't wait for permission. She just built it.

That's why the ambassadors put £500 behind her this month.

__[SHOW GINA SOME LOVE →](https://www.instagram.com/nudumskincare/)__

View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/0822e16f-8c33-4aed-afd2-39b78679f062/Frame_110.png?t=1780924495)
Caption: 

🙌** June's Most Helpful: Jaime Ross**

Some people join a community and ask.

Jaime joined and _gave_.

Answering questions. Jumping on other people's problems. Showing up for founders he's never met - expecting nothing back.

Give without take. Jaime lives it.

If he's helped you, tell him: **@freshpixel** on HelpBnk.

-HelpBnk

_P.S. Want the £500 next month? It doesn't go to the loudest person. It goes to the one who helps the most. Start now._


———

