From exclusive member resources to professional development and industry events, ETC is committed to supporting the educational travel community. Here's what's happening!










Member Benefit Spotlight: Exclusive Job Postings
One of the many benefits of ETC membership is access to our members-only job board. Active member organizations can submit open positions to ETC for posting, connecting with professionals across the educational travel community. Members can also explore career opportunities shared by fellow organizations, making this exclusive resource valuable for both employers and job seekers.




Upcoming Member Webinar: 
Building for AI Discovery July 23rd, 2026
REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED


AI is changing how travelers discover organizations. Join Susan Black, founder of Wowzitude, for a practical webinar on how to make your brand more visible in AI-powered search. Learn actionable strategies for creating AI-friendly content, strengthening your online presence, and measuring your visibility—using real-world examples from alumni travel, cultural tourism, DMCs, and tour operators.


By the end of this session, participants will be able to:

• Restructure their content and web presence so AI tools surface and cite their brand as a trusted answer
• Use leader-led content to build the authority signals AI rewards
• Track and measure how and when AI is recommending their organization

APPLY FOR ETC MEMBERSHIP




Registration Is Open for the 2027 ETC Annual Conference
February 21-25, 2027 in Richmond, VA


Registration is now open for the 2027 ETC Annual Conferencein Richmond, Virginia! Join colleagues from across the educational travel community for engaging educational sessions, meaningful networking, and opportunities to exchange ideas and best practices.

The ETC Annual Conference is a members-only event, so attendees must have an active ETC membership to register. If your membership has lapsed, now is the perfect time to renew and reconnect with the ETC community.

An ETC membership provides year-round value through professional development, industry insights, networking opportunities, exclusive member resources—including our members-only job board—and discounted conference registration.




Former Members: We'd love to welcome you back. Contact us to renew your membership.
New to ETC? Apply today and discover the benefits of being part of our growing educational travel community.

APPLY FOR NEW ETC MEMBERSHIP
