Join us Friday, July 24 through Sunday, July 26 for Here Eternally | هنا إلى الأبد, the Museum of the Palestinian People's annual festival celebrating Palestinian art, culture, history, and community.

Across three days, you'll experience an Opening Night dinner with live music and a panel discussion, a Palestinian Souq, a film screening, children's programming, hands-on workshops, a community soccer tournament, and Palestinian food vendors. 

Whether you join us for one event or the entire weekend, we hope you'll celebrate with us.

View the full festival schedule and reserve your tickets today.

We look forward to welcoming you.

The Museum of the Palestinian People Team

 

