Most people never say their dream out loud.

Not to a mate. Not even to themselves.

And that’s exactly why it stays a dream.

So we’re fixing it. This Tuesday, in London:

**HelpBnk Presents: Pitch Perfect**

📍 Tradestars, Islington

🗓 Tuesday 7th July, 18:30-20:30

🎟 £5 - and that includes a free drink

Adam Moss, HelpBnk’s CEO, breaks down what makes a pitch actually land. Then it gets real: audience members pitch live, get honest feedback, and watch their idea get sharper in the room.

Nobody expects polish. The room’s on your side.

And if you’re feeling brave… the **Doorbell of Dreams** will be waiting.

Only 30 tickets, and it’s this Tuesday.

[👉 Grab My Seat](https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/pitch-perfect-with-helpbnk-tradestars-islington-tickets-1992753428147)

-HelpBnk

**P.S.** The messy first pitch is the point. Show up scrappy, leave sharper.


