Before your July fills up, hold the evening of Thursday the 16th.

We’re taking over a beach tennis club in London, and you’re invited.

**HelpBnk Takeover @ Bola Beach Tennis**

🗓 Thursday 16th July

🎾 All equipment provided. Zero skill required.

View image: (https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/5e1d52e8-1f6d-47d1-a227-ee69e50d4142/bola-sunset-social-2026.png?t=1783023245)
Caption: 

Brazilian beach vibes, good music, sunset views, and the whole HelpBnk team there to play.

We’re also bringing the **Doorbell of Dreams**. Pitch your dream on the spot and we’ll send a personalised deck straight to your inbox.

Tickets just went live and spots are limited.

[👉 Save My Spot](https://bolabeachtennis.as.me/schedule/51a04503/?appointmentTypeIds[]=95092579)

-HelpBnk

**P.S.** You’ve got two weeks to rope your mates in. Send them this.


