Dear Friend,

This year's Opening Night of  Here Eternally | هنا إلى الأبد begins with a shared meal that celebrates Palestinian hospitality, tradition, and the power of gathering in community.

We're honored to welcome Kanoun Smokehouse as the sponsor and caterer of our Opening Night Dinner.

Known for bringing Palestinian flavors to life through thoughtful, contemporary cooking rooted in tradition, Kanoun's menu reflects the stories, ingredients, and culinary heritage that have sustained our people for generations.

As we gather together, you'll enjoy an evening that pairs incredible food with meaningful conversation and live music all within the Museum of the Palestinian People's annual festival.

Your Opening Night ticket includes:

• A catered Palestinian dinner by Kanoun Smokehouse
• A conversation with distinguished Palestinian professionals: a psychologist, author, and journalist, reflecting on resilience, storytelling, and this historic moment for our community
• Live musical performances celebrating Palestinian culture
• The opportunity to connect with artists, organizers, supporters, and community members from across the DMV and beyond

Food has always been one of the ways Palestinians carry memory forward. Every dish tells a story. Every shared table reminds us that culture is something we continue to create together.

Join us as we open a weekend dedicated to Palestinian art, history, and community.

Secure your spot for Friday here. 



 



Support MPP Monthly



 



Follow Our Instagram

