Email from The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C. Join our team! Dear ICS Friends, We are getting ready for another wonderful school year and are looking to welcome a new teacher to our Italian Children's Program. The position includes teaching on Saturdays, Mondays, and Fridays, as well as after-school courses at local private schools. This is a great opportunity for someone who enjoys working with children and is passionate about promoting the Italian language and culture. There is also the possibility of growing into the role of Children's Program Coordinator, as well as teaching adult language courses. Please check our website for more information about the position and how to apply. We would greatly appreciate it if you could share this opportunity with anyone who might be interested. Buona estate! Francesca Casazza, Executive Director & CEO       Share This Email Share This Email Share This Email   Our Company | Contact Us | FAQs | Privacy Policy   The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C. | 4833 Rugby Ave Suite 201 | Bethesda, MD 20814 US Unsubscribe | Update Profile | Constant Contact Data Notice<!DOCTYPE HTML>
