    Employer Partner Update | Summer 2026
  



 

  

    Thank you for your continued partnership with Morgan State University's Center for Career Development. We're excited to share opportunities to recruit Morgan talent, engage with students, and strengthen your presence on campus during the 2026-2027 academic year.
  



 
 
 

  

    
  



 

  

    Thank You to Our 2025-2026 Student Success Sponsors
  



 

  

    We are grateful to our Student Success Sponsors for their partnership and investment in Morgan State University students. Your support helps expand access to career exploration, experiential learning, employer engagement, and professional development opportunities that prepare students for lifelong career success.
Thank you for helping create meaningful experiences and stronger career outcomes for Morgan students.
  



 

  

    Partner with Morgan Through Sponsorship
  



 

  

    Looking to deepen your partnership? Our 2026-2027 Student Success Sponsorship Program offers year-round opportunities to strengthen your campus presence, connect with Morgan students and alumni, and enhance your recruiting efforts through priority access to career fairs, networking events, employer branding opportunities, on-campus recruiting, and more.
Whether you're looking to build your talent pipeline, increase brand visibility, or support student success, we'd welcome the opportunity to partner with you.
  



 

  

    
      
        View Sponsorship Opportunities
      
    
  



 
 
 

  

    Fall 2026 Recruiting Events
  



 

  

    Registration Now Open!
  



 

  

    
  



 

  

