    Thursday, September 3 • 11 a.m. – 1 p.m. • USC PatioLooking to hire part-time employees? Meet Morgan students seeking part-time, seasonal, flexible, and on-campus employment opportunities.
  



 

  

    
      
        Register for On-Campus & Part-Time Job Fair
      
    
  



 
 
 

  

    
  



 

  

    Fall 2026 Career & Internship Fair
  



 

  

    Wednesday, September 30 • 10 a.m. – 2 p.m. • USC BallroomConnect with hundreds of Morgan students and alumni from a wide range of majors. Recruit for internships, full-time positions, and early career opportunities while building your brand on campus.
  



 

  

    
      
        Register for Career & Internship Fair
      
    
  



 
 
 

  

    
  



 

  

    Fall 2026 Networking Mixer
  



 

  

    Thursday, November 5 • 5 p.m. – 7 p.m. • Legacy HallConnect with Morgan students in a more personal, relationship-focused setting. Through guided networking rounds and an open networking reception, employers can build meaningful relationships, increase brand visibility, share career insights, and identify future talent.
  



 

  

    
      
