You can have the best idea in the room.

But if you can't say it in a way that makes people lean in, it just stays an idea.

That's what a good pitch does for you. **And it's the whole point of Pitch Perfect.**

It's a small, in-person evening of live pitch coaching with Adam Moss, our CEO. Not a slides-and-theory thing. Adam pulls apart what actually makes a pitch land, then gets people up on stage to try it for real, in front of the room.

You'll hear real pitches and real feedback. You'll get a go at tightening your own. And you'll do it somewhere that's genuinely on your side, which counts for a lot the first time you say your idea out loud.

Whether you're building a business, starting a side hustle, trying to raise, or just sitting on a dream you haven't told anyone yet, this is where you get better at telling it.

Because at some point you'll get your shot. Maybe an investor. Maybe a customer. Maybe the Doorbell of Dreams. Whenever it comes, you'll want to be ready.

**Here's the where and when:**

📍 TradeStars Islington, 4–10 North Road, London N7 9EY
📅 Tuesday 7 July, 6:30–8:30pm

Small room, so there aren't many tickets. And it's a week today.

[GET YOUR TICKETS →](https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/pitch-perfect-with-helpbnk-tradestars-islington-tickets-1992753428147)

-HelpBnk

_P.S. You'll learn plenty just watching. But the people who put their hand up and actually pitch? They leave different. Be one of them._


