Every founder hits a point where they feel stuck.

Growth slows down…
The next hire feels impossible…
Fundraising isn't going to plan…

You're working harder than ever, but not seeing the results you'd hoped for.

That's exactly what we sat down to talk about last week with Roei Samuel and if you couldn't make it live, [the recording's now ready to watch back](https://youtu.be/LTacB0ut0ng)[.](https://youtu.be/LTacB0ut0ng)

Roei built and scaled RealSport to millions of monthly users before successfully exiting the business. Today, as Founder & CEO of Connectd, he's helped thousands of startups connect with the investors, advisors and experienced operators who can actually accelerate growth. He's seen firsthand what separates the businesses that break through from the ones that stay stuck, and he was generous with all of it.

**Here's what we got into:**

* The biggest growth challenges founders are facing today

* The common mistakes that quietly hold businesses back

* How successful founders think differently

* The role advisors and fractional talent can play in accelerating growth

* A live Q&A, where Roei answered real questions from founders

It wasn't a presentation. It was a proper conversation with someone who has built, exited, invested in and advised businesses at every stage of growth.

So grab a coffee, press play, and bring your toughest challenge. You'll come away with something you can put to work straight away.

[**WATCH THE RECORDING →**](https://youtu.be/LTacB0ut0ng)

The HelpBnk Team

_P.S. If you’re interested in Connectd and getting expert fractional help, you can find out more _[_here._](https://g5gbovmobgg.typeform.com/to/RgFerPK1)


———

