An annual ETC membership provides year-round access to exclusive educational programming and networking opportunities, along with member-only early-bird registration pricing for the annual conference. Upcoming member-exclusive opportunities include:
2027 ETC Conference registration is now open, with early-bird pricing.July 23 Webinar:Building for AI Discovery: How Travel Brands Get Found in the Age of AI—an exclusive session exploring how AI is changing the way travelers discover destinations and tourism businesses.
Former Members: Please contact us to renew your membership. 
New Members: Fill out the membership application online (link below)

APPLY FOR ETC MEMBERSHIP




39th ETC Conference 
February 21-25, 2027 in Richmond, VA
REGISTRATION IS LIVE


Conference registration is now open! The ETC Annual Conference is a members-only event, so attendees must have an active ETC membership to register. If your membership has lapsed, now is the perfect time to renew and reconnect with the ETC community.

An ETC membership provides year-round value through professional development, industry insights, networking opportunities, exclusive member resources, and member-only early-bird conference pricing.




Building for AI Discovery:
How Travel Brands Get Found in the Age of AI
Member only Webinar July 23rd, 2026
REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED


AI is changing how travelers discover destinations and experiences. Join industry expert Susan Black to learn practical strategies for helping your organization get found in AI-powered search using real-world examples and actionable insights.


By the end of this session, participants will be able to:

• Restructure their content and web presence so AI tools surface and cite their brand as a trusted answer
• Use leader-led content to build the authority signals AI rewards
• Track and measure how and when AI is recommending their organization

APPLY FOR ETC MEMBERSHIP








This email was sent on behalf of Educational Travel Consortium located at 27 NE 55th Ave, Portland, OR, 97213.To unsubscribe click here. If you have questions or comments concerning this email contact Educational Travel Consortium at etc@educationaltravelconsortium.com.



