Email from SCORE Build Trust, Increase Sales and Keep Customers Coming Back Not seeing images? View in browser.﻿     Win Customers, Build Loyalty and Increase Sales With Emotional Intelligence  Tuesday, June 30 | 1:00 PM ET | $15 Learn how to use emotional intelligence to strengthen trust, improve customer interactions and create experiences that keep people coming back. REGISTER   Hi Dave, Winning new customers is important, but keeping them is what helps a business grow. Many small business owners focus on what they offer, what they know or what they want customers to do next. But building strong customer relationships actually comes down to making people feel heard, valued and understood. Join Chuck Garcia, Columbia University professor, bestselling author and three-time TEDx speaker, for a practical webinar on how emotional intelligence can help you build stronger customer relationships, improve communication and create better business outcomes. Drawing from timeless relationship-building principles and his experience teaching leadership and communication, Chuck will show you how self-awareness, social awareness, empathy and calm under pressure can influence the way customers respond to you and your business. In this session, you’ll learn how to use emotional intelligence to strengthen trust, improve customer interactions and create experiences that keep people coming back. In this webinar, you will learn: How emotional intelligence can help you attract, retain and better serve customers How to shift your focus from selling to understanding what customers value How self-awareness and social awareness improve communication and trust How to use genuine appreciation without sounding forced or insincere How empathy can improve sales, service and difficult customer conversations How to stay calm under pressure and respond more effectively in challenging situations REGISTER NOW Can't attend the webinar live? Register anyway, and the slides and replay will be available to you in SCORE Academy. You will need to log in to SCORE Academy to access your products. Brought to You By: MEET THE PRESENTER Chuck Garcia is a best-selling author, professional speaker, Columbia University professor, mountaineer, and career elevation coach. A leading expert in emotional intelligence and transformational leadership, his works have empowered global executives, emerging professionals, and creative minds worldwide. He is a 3-time TEDx speaker, and previously spent 25+ years on Wall Street. Learn more about Chuck>     SCORE is a nonprofit association dedicated to helping small businesses get off the ground, grow and achieve their goals through education and mentorship. We have been doing this for more than 60 years.   Thanks to our network of 7,000+ volunteers, we are able to deliver our services at no charge or at a very low cost. Find out more about our mission, vision and values. Connect With Us:                         SCORE Association | 712 H St NE PMB 98848 | Washington, DC 20002 US Unsubscribe | Update Profile | Our Privacy Policy | Constant Contact Data Notice<!DOCTYPE HTML>
