Email from The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C.     Dear ICS Friends, Join us for a special screening of Nuovo Cinema Paradiso (International Theatrical Version), one of the most beloved films in Italian cinema. Winner of the Academy Award for Best Foreign Language Film, Cinema Paradiso is a heartwarming celebration of friendship, community, and the magic of movies. Set in a small Sicilian town, the film follows the lifelong bond between a young boy and the projectionist of the local cinema, offering a nostalgic tribute to the power of storytelling and the shared experience of film. Phoenix Theatres Village 14 + PTX, will generously donate the proceeds from tickets sales to the Italian Cultural Society of Washington, D.C. Guests 21 and older with valid ID can enjoy a special $8 Aperol Spritz available at the theater during the event. Saturday, July 25, 2026 7:00 PM Location Phoenix Theatres Village 14 + PTX 1600 Village Market Blvd SE #116 Leesburg, VA 20175 Please visit our Upcoming Events webpage to purchase your tickets. Ci vediamo al cinema! The ICS Team       Share This Email Share This Email Share This Email The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C. | 4833 Rugby Ave Suite 201 | Bethesda, MD 20814 US Unsubscribe | Update Profile | Constant Contact Data Notice<!DOCTYPE HTML>
