Finding the right hire is a bit like dating. Everyone looks great on a first date. It's only three months in you realise they chew with their mouth open and catfished you on why they wanted to work there…

Leila Hormozi built 16 companies over 10 years to a combined net worth of $100 million. 

Her top rule: if someone's personal goals don't align with the business goals, no amount of management patches it. They'll do what's needed to keep their job. That's it.

How do you filter candidates? Use Leila’s ultimate interview test. Share something you've genuinely got wrong recently, then ask your interviewee to do the same. The people who open up honestly are showing you the culture you want. The ones who can't think of a single flaw? They just showed you everything.

Leila gave us the full blueprint on leadership, delegation, and finding talent, all in one sitting.

👉 [Watch Leila Hormozi's Blueprint On How To Build A Million Dollar Team](https://youtu.be/fABX411MixY?si=6y_EaxRmLN3wfjg1)

– HelpBnk

P.S. If you don't know where your weaknesses are as a leader, look at your team. Their gaps are yours.


