Join Kailash Pathak (Senior QA Lead Manager, 3Pillar) and Shubham Zapate (Product Growth Manager II, BrowserStack) to learn how self-healing locators, AI agents, and LLMs are transforming test automation. See how AI-powered workflows can cut maintenance effort by up to 5x and speed up failure analysis.

