Hi Dave,

Thank you for sending your VEP form.  Can you please enter your individual name before your business name on the Vendor/Payee Name line?  We will need for the VEP form to match the W-9 to process the ACH request.

We will also need either a voided check or an account verification letter from Wells Fargo.  Please make sure it has your full name and address as well as your full account and routing numbers.

Sincerely,
Page


