Hi,

We received your recent request for the set-up of ACH payments from Fairfax County. Can you please complete the attached VEP form and provide the additional documentation as outlined at the bottom of the form? We received the W-9 you previously submitted so you do not need to send it again. Please reply to this email with the completed documentation.
REMINDER: Please read the entirety of the VEP form, as the bottom outlines additional documentation that may need to be provided.
Sincerely,
