<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Hi Dave,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><br>
Thank you for sending your VEP form.&nbsp; Can you please enter your individual name before your business name on the Vendor/Payee Name line?&nbsp; We will need for the VEP form to match the W-9 to process the ACH request.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">We will also need either a voided check or an account verification letter from Wells Fargo.&nbsp;

