Dear null,


Earlier this week I extended our End of Financial Year enrolment offer to our valued subscribers until 5pm Friday 26th June (tomorrow).

Tomorrow’s deadline is your last chance to Let YOU out and turn your interest in helping others into something bigger and find joy in work that makes a difference.

But you must act quickly. Enrolments close strictly at 5pm Friday 26th June.

If you would like to develop your natural helping skills, Let YOU out and change your own future by learning to help others then this is the best chance are likely to get.

And remember, with our Guarantee of Education Excellence, you can enrol entirely risk free.

Enrol now here (http://www.aipc.net.au/eofy2026?utm_source=AIPC&utm_campaign=92e5347ebc-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_EZINE_2026_May18_COPY_03&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_-5ddf79d137-49047108)

Yours in Counselling,

Sandra Poletto
