This is your moment to Let YOU Out
Dear null,

As a valued subscriber of our ezine, this email is about YOU – and the counsellor you already feel yourself becoming.
It’s an invitation to stop holding back and start giving yourself permission to do what’s been calling you for a while now:

* To help others
* To change direction, and
* Step into a more authentic version of yourself.

If you’ve been thinking about making a real difference in people’s lives — and beginning the Diploma of Counselling — this is your moment.

Our End of Financial Year Enrolment Offer (https://offer.aipc.net.au/eofy2026/?utm_source=AIPC&utm_campaign=575ac05e27-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_EZINE_2026_May18_COPY_01&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_-5ddf79d137-&utm_source=AIPC&utm_campaign=e6725945a1-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_EZINE_2026_May18_COPY_03&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_-5ddf79d137-49047108) is available until 5pm this Friday 19^th June and there are only
places available at this discounted rate.  You will receive:
* $4,335 in course savings
* $10,155 in educational bonuses
* $14,490 in total savings and bonuses

This week is your moment to let YOU OUT.
Ready for a career that’s more you? Become a counsellor.

Enrol here now (https://offer.aipc.net.au/eofy2026/?utm_source=AIPC&utm_campaign=e6725945a1-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_EZINE_2026_May18_COPY_03&utm_medium=email&utm_term=0_-5ddf79d137-49047108)

Want to talk it through first?
Phone: 1800 657 667
Email:
headoffice@aipc.net.au (mailto:headoffice@aipc.net.au)

Yours in Education,
Sandra Poletto
Chief Executive Officer
Australian Institute of Professional Counsellors

