Email from The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C.     Dear ICS Friends, We are pleased to share an exciting opportunity for your children to participate in an international educational program taking place in New York this July. The Ministero dell’Istruzione e del merito - Ufficio Scolastico Regionale per il Lazio - Istituto di Istruzione Superiore - Apicio Colonna Gatti is organizing a student delegation to attend and contribute to the High-Level Political Forum on Sustainable Development (HLPF) at the United Nations (https://hlpf.un.org/). As part of this initiative, a limited number of students from local schools are invited to join the program “NextGen 2030 NY.” This is a fully funded opportunity (travel, accommodation, and program costs are covered) taking place from July 12 at 9:00 am to July 14 at 5:00pm, 2026, in New York City. The delegation should include up to 6 highly motivated and outstanding students aged 16 to 18, accompanied by two teachers who will participate in the training workshop. About the program: Students will participate in interactive workshops focused on global citizenship, sustainability, and the UN Sustainable Development Goals (Agenda 2030). Students will attend selected sessions of the UN High-Level Political Forum. Participants will collaborate with peers from Italy and other institutions to develop and present innovative project ideas. The program will culminate in a formal presentation during an official side event at the United Nations. This is a unique chance for students to gain international exposure, engage with global policy discussions, and develop skills in collaboration, critical thinking, and project design. Our instructor Khadija Taufiq (and another one t.b.d) will accompany the students from Washington. Please let us know as soon as possible if your child would be interested and available to participate, as timelines for confirmation are quite tight. We would be happy to provide additional details and next steps.  Warm regards, The ICS Team       Share This Email Share This Email Share This Email The Italian Cultural Society of Washington D.C. | 4833 Rugby Ave Suite 201 | Bethesda, MD 20814 US Unsubscribe | Update Profile | Constant Contact Data Notice<!DOCTYPE HTML>
