# Built something worth talking about?

Then don't keep it to yourself.

Applications for the SeedLegals Startup Awards close this Sunday, and this could be your opportunity to put your startup in front of some of the biggest names in the UK startup ecosystem. **Applications close on 21 June.**

Last year saw over 1,000 nominations, with founders, investors and innovators from across the UK recognised for the impact they were making.

## **Why enter?**

🏆 Build credibility with investors, customers and partners

🚀 Raise your profile across the startup ecosystem

🤝 Join a community of ambitious founders and investors

💰 One startup will receive a £50,000 investment offer as part of the awards programme.

Applying only takes around 6 minutes and you can enter multiple categories!

If you've spent the last few years building, growing, and overcoming challenge after challenge, **this is your chance to get recognised for it.**

Don't count yourself out!!

The founders who get shortlisted are rarely the ones who think they're guaranteed to wAin. They're the ones who put themselves forward.

APPLY NOW → (https://seedlegalsawards.com/)

Good luck,

The HelpBnk Team


