Hi,
Do you receive my last email?
Actually, I have not received any response from your side.
Kindly let me know if you are interested in our services so that we can move
ahead.
Thank you.

 ----------------------------

 

From: Vikram,

Sent: Thursday, May 28, 2026 4:58 PM

To: info@mangiadc.com

Subject: RE: Customized Website Development!

 

Hi,

I hope you are doing well.

I wanted to introduce our web development and AI-powered solutions. We are
an India-based team helping businesses build modern, responsive websites and
enhance customer engagement through intelligent chatbot integration and
automation.

Our expertise includes CMS development, e-commerce platforms, full-stack
development (WordPress, Shopify, Wix, PHP, HTML), AI chatbots, customer
support automation, and business process optimization.

Please let me know if you have any upcoming projects or requirements. I
would be happy to discuss and share a proposal.

Thanks & Regards,
Vikram
Marketing Manager

 

