Destinations, Operators or Suppliers (DOS) Membership, Registration Rates and Deadlines:

ATTENDEE CLASSIFICATIONEarly Bird 
June 15 - Sept 30Regular
Oct 01 - Jan 15, 2027Late
Jan 16 - Feb. 21, 2027Required Annual Membership$475$475$475
Conference Registration
1st person$1395$1620$1875
Conference Registration
2nd person (or third)$720$820$920



Conference registration is now open! You must be an Active ETC member in order to register for the conference. To purchase membership, click on the link below. Then to register please log in using your ETC membership credentials (username and password) in order to register for the conference. If you experience any issues accessing your account, please contact support@educationaltravelconsortium.com for assistance.

RENEW  ETC MEMBERSHIP


You will be prompted to book your hotel through the official ETC room block link during registration. We recommend arriving on Sunday and departing Thursday morning, unless you are participating in Learning Labs, which conclude Thursday evening. Please refer to the agenda overview below for additional scheduling guidance.

ETC 2027 39th Annual Travel Conference - Start your hotel reservations




















Destinations, Operators or Suppliers (DOS) Membership  Registration:
The “DOS” category of registration includes tour operators, destinations, destination management companies, and travel suppliers who serve the educational, alumni, and nonprofit travel market niche.

DOS REGISTRATION










Refund Policy: Cancellations received on or before January 7, 2027 (45 days prior to the start of the conference) are eligible for a refund, minus a $75 administrative fee. No refunds will be issued for cancellations received after January 7, 2027.
This email was sent on behalf of Educational Travel Consortium located at 27 NE 55th Ave, Portland, OR, 97213.To unsubscribe click here. If you have questions or comments concerning this email contact Educational Travel Consortium at etc@educationaltravelconsortium.com.



