Hey there,

When you’re choosing what to build next, proof beats promises.  Here’s a quick look at what crowdspring clients shipped with real designers, not prompts:

[Image not available in text version]

Made by people who ask questions. 100% human‑crafted design. Custom, not canned.

You’ve also got a bonus on the table

If you grabbed the Essential Branding Toolkit, you unlocked $134 in savings ($35 off + free $99 Advanced Promotion) for your next project. Didn’t download yet? Grab the Toolkit now, and the savings will be waiting when you’re ready.

Get the Toolkit and my special $134 discount: https://assets.crowdspring.com/marketing/landing-page/guides/crowdspring-essential-branding-kit-ver-1-0.zip 

Want a human to map the smartest next move?

Book a free 30-minute Brand Gameplan (normally $199). No slides. No pitch. You’ll get, right after the call:

* A 1‑page 90‑day plan with 2–3 next moves in the right order
* Rough timelines & budget ranges so you can move with confidence
* A quick consistency checklist for your top channels

Reply with two times you’re available (and your time zone).

What should you build next?

Since your last project was  Logo &amp; Identity , the common next steps that keep momentum are:

* Logo → Custom Landing Page, Packaging Starter, or Website Refresh
* Packaging → Product Detail Page, Retail Display, or Sell‑Sheet
* Website → Focused Landing Page, Email Template. Pick one. Build momentum. We’ll help you brief it fast.

Whichever path you choose—start a project, get the Toolkit, or book the 1:1—you’ll have a clearer next step and a human on your side.

Thanks,

Marc Boyle
Head of Customer Support and Success

