Royal Bread

Here we present our not-so-traditional sourdough, crafted from a sourdough starter using flour gifted to us by His Royal Majesty _____ of ______. Yes, by a “King” but we can’t talk about it so you’ll have to come in to find out more.

 

[spring egg custard](https://resy.com/cities/washington-dc/venues/little-pearl?date=2025-06-06&seats=2)

 

The hardest part of this dish? Figuring out what to pair with it. Growing up Chef's idea of a "fancy restaurant" was Olive Garden. So it only made sense to pay respects to the classic bread and olive oil featured there. Adding ricotta was just the icing on the cake.

 

[BOOK HERE](https://resy.com/cities/washington-dc/venues/little-pearl?date=2025-06-06&seats=2)

 

ALSO ON THE MENU 👀 

Angel Eggs Pork Neck al Pastor Strawberry, Basil, Shortcake ...AND MORE!

[BOOK HERE](https://resy.com/cities/washington-dc/venues/little-pearl?date=2025-06-06&seats=2)

 

