    Employer Newsletter- June 2026
  



 

  

    
  



 

  

    Meet Our New Assistant Director of External Relations!
  



 

  

    The Towson University Career Center is pleased to welcome Kalin Dodson as our new Assistant Director of External Relations. Kalin joined the Career Center in May and is a proud TU alumna. She will support employer engagement within the Liberal Arts and Media, Arts & Communication Career Communities.
Kalin looks forward to connecting with employers and building collaborative partnerships that create meaningful opportunities for TU students and alumni through on-campus recruitment and programming.
If you are interested in recruiting Towson University talent within these areas, we encourage you to reach out to Kalin and introduce yourself!
  



 
 
 

  

    Fair Registrations Open – Fall 2026
  



 

  

    2026 Part-Time & On-Campus Job Fair
Wednesday, August 26 • 3–5 p.m. • UU Ballrooms
Need to hire some great part-time employees? This fair allows you to meet, interview and hire TU students to fill your part-time, short-term and seasonal positions!
  



 

  

    
      
        Register for Part-Time Job Fair
      
    
  



 

  

    Fall 2026 Career & Internship Fair
Friday, October 16 • 11 a.m. – 2 p.m. • SECU Arena
With more than 1,000 students from all majors expected to attend, this is your opportunity to meet motivated candidates seeking full-time roles, internships, and early career opportunities.
  



 

  

    
      
        Register for Career & Internship Fair
      
    
  



 
 
 

  

    
  



 

  

    Career Center Partnership Program
  



 

  

    There are many advantages to becoming an official partner, including a dedicated representative assisting with your recruiting plan. Enjoy targeted benefits of an expanded campus presence and direct connections to our talented students and alumni!
  



 

  

    
      
        Become a Partner
      
    
  



 
 
 

  

    Save the Dates – Fall 2026
  



 

  

    Plug Into Tech InternshipsThursday, September 17 • 4–6 p.m.
This fair connects employers with students pursuing Computer Information Systems and related technology fields. Register for a great opportunity to recruit internship talent in areas such as data analytics, cybersecurity, software development, IT consulting, and business technology while engaging with motivated students preparing for careers in tech!
  



 

  

    
      
        Plug Into Tech Internships – Employer Interest Form
      
    
  



 

  

    2026 Actuarial Science and Risk Management FairFriday, October 2 • Noon–3 p.m.
This event connects employers with students interested in actuarial science, risk management, insurance, finance, analytics, and related career paths. Employers will have the opportunity to promote internships and full-time roles, build brand awareness, and connect with students preparing for careers in risk-focused industries.
Registration coming soon!
  



 
 
 

  

    Connect with Us
