Hi Dave,

24 hours to go and hundreds of QA and engineering leaders are already in.

Manual test creation and endless maintenance are slowing your releases. Tomorrow, Neil Crichton (QA Lead, Mercury NZ) and Aniket Tambe (Product Manager - AI, BrowserStack) show you the exact frameworks they use to eliminate those bottlenecks and ship faster, without breaking production.
Save Your Spot (https://www.browserstack.com/webinars/ship-4x-faster?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=mailchimp-prefilled&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=WBN-AI-TA-11th-June-26&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rBISwYAO&utm_term=One_Day_To_Go_Individual_June_11_New_Email&uid=ecf19809c8)

Here is what you will walk away with:
* The exact steps to integrate AI into your current QA workflows without disrupting active pipelines.
* How to drastically reduce test maintenance hours and focus your team on high-value execution.
* Real-world examples of how Mercury NZ approaches complex testing challenges.

The standard for QA is changing tomorrow, with or without you. Do not let your competitors figure this out first.

[Secure Your Seat] (https://www.browserstack.com/webinars/ship-4x-faster?utm_source=Livewebinar&utm_medium=email&utm_platform=mailchimp-prefilled&utm_content=digitalevent&utm_campaign=WBN-AI-TA-11th-June-26&utm_campaigncode=701OW00000rBISwYAO&utm_term=One_Day_To_Go_Individual_June_11_New_Email&uid=ecf19809c8)

Best Regards,
Adam Bernard

