39th ETC Conference 
February 21-25, 2027 in Richmond, VA
REGISTRATION OPENS JUNE 15TH, 2026




Registration deadlines:
Early Bird: June 15th - October 30th 2026
Regular: October 31st - January 15th 2027
Late: January 16th - February 21st 2027

For more info and pricing, visit our website. 




ETC Member Webinar Peace Tourism in Northern Ireland
JUNE 24th, 2026 10:00 AM PST 
Open to all including prospective members. 










This webinar will explore what Peace Tourism is, alongside key considerations for developing responsible and authentic visitor experiences. It will highlight visitor motivations, ethical interpretation, and the importance of collaboration across the sector. Ideal for travel planners and DOS looking to incorporate Peace Tourism into their programs.








Participants will:


Learn about Northern Ireland’s transformation from conflict to peace and prosperityExplore what Peace Tourism isGain insight into the Conflict and Legacy Interpretive Network and its role in ethical storytellingUnderstand the motivations of international visitors engaging with Peace Tourism experiencesKey considerations for developing meaningful and authentic visitor experiences, with examples of best practice showcased







WEBINAR REGISTRATION
















More exclusive member programming is on the way, including "Building for AI Discovery: SEO for the Age of AI." Renew your membership today to ensure access to this and other upcoming member-only learning opportunities.

RENEW  ETC MEMBERSHIP
This email was sent on behalf of Educational Travel Consortium located at 27 NE 55th Ave, Portland, OR, 97213.To unsubscribe click here. If you have questions or comments concerning this email contact Educational Travel Consortium at etc@educationaltravelconsortium.com.



