Hey there,

We made the Essential Branding Toolkit to help you plan what’s next, but you shouldn’t have to wait to get value.

So here are three ideas you can use right now (no download needed):

1) 10‑Second Homepage Headline (copy‑and‑paste)

* Template: We help [who] get [result] with [your product/service].
* Example: “We help busy cafés sell more to‑go orders with fast, bold menus.”
* Pro tip: Keep it under 12 words. Pair with one clear CTA (call-to-action).

2) Consistency Sweep (5 checks in 5 minutes)

* Logo: same file used on site, socials, email footer
* Color: identical primary/secondary HEX across channels
* Type: same font families/weights on web + print
* Voice: headline + CTA tone match across top pages
* Bio: website + Instagram + email signature say the same one‑liner

If you mark 3 or more fixes, you’re ready for a simple plan.

3) Next‑Move Picker (choose one path)

Since your last project was  Logo &amp; Identity on October 08, 2013:

* Logo → Custom Landing Page, Packaging Starter, or Website Refresh
* Packaging → Product Detail Page, Retail Display, or Sell‑Sheet
* Website → Focused Landing Page, Email Template. Pick one. Build momentum. We’ll help you brief it fast.

Get the full Toolkit (+ auto‑applied savings)

The download adds checklists, examples, and prompts, and includes $134 in savings ($35 off + free $99 Advanced Promotion) for your next project.

Get the Essential Branding Toolkit: https://assets.crowdspring.com/marketing/landing-page/guides/crowdspring-essential-branding-kit-ver-1-0.zip

Want a human to turn this into your 90‑day plan?

Book a free 30‑min Brand Gameplan with a crowdspring expert (normally $199). No slides. No pitch. You’ll get, right after the call:

* A 1‑page 90‑day plan with 2–3 next moves in the right order
* Rough timelines & budget ranges so you can plan with confidence
* A quick consistency checklist for your top channels

Reply with two times you’re available and your time zone.

Not up for a meeting? Reply AUDIT with one link or screenshot (homepage, design, flyer, post). We’ll reply within 48 business hours with 3 fixes.

Whichever path you choose, it’s human‑made help, not prompts, and you’ll leave with a clear next step.

Thanks,

Marc Boyle
Head of Customer Support and Success

P.S. We hold a handful of free Brand Gameplan slots each week while we run this pilot (normally $199). Your $134 savings lives inside the Toolkit and is easy to apply when you’re ready to start.


