Check out one of the watch parties below and enjoy the game with fellow fans. From 5:00 - 6:30 pm. Telemundo and NBC4 Washington will be broadcasting live from Takoma Park, with coverage from both the Laurel Avenue Streetery and Cielo Rojo.

Watch Parties:

Cielo Rojo (https://www.cielo-rojo.com/) , 7211 Carroll Ave
