A few people from last year's accelerator. **Their words, not ours.**

_"I sent out my first £2,500 offer. I got 45 responses to my messages. I made 20 TikTok videos, 3 Instagram posts, a LinkedIn post and added a CTA on my bio."_

_"Learned more than in my 4-year business degree."_

_"I'm so grateful. Did things I'd never done before. Had a few potential clients on trial."_

_"Very great stuff. School educations should be made of this."_

These aren't actors David.

They're regular people who showed up to the free accelerator earlier this year, did the homework, and finished with a real business.

Some had ideas going in. Most didn't. Some had skills. Most didn't.

What they had in common was the willingness to **try one more time.**

And this year, with AI in the mix, what took them weeks could take you days.

