The Art of Sipping Silver

Most tequila lovers think silver tequila is only meant for cocktails.
We disagree.
AsomBroso El Platino Silver was created to showcase the pure character of a=
gave in its most natural form. Crafted with only three ingredients=E2=80=94=
100% Blue Weber Agave, deep well water, and yeast=E2=80=94our additive-free=
 silver tequila highlights the flavors and aromas that make tequila one of =
the world=E2=80=99s great spirits.
=C2=A0
Made from slow-cooked Blue Weber Agave grown in the Tequila Valley of Jalis=
co, El Platino undergoes multiple distillations and filtration to create ex=
ceptional smoothness while preserving the authentic character of the agave.=
 The result is a tequila that is crisp, elegant, and remarkably approachabl=
e.=C2=A0
=C2=A0

What You=E2=80=99ll Discover In Every Sip

Aroma
Fresh cooked agave, citrus, and subtle herbal notes.=C2=A0
Palate
Bright citrus, earthy sweetness, and delicate herbal character balanced by =
a silky texture.=C2=A0
Finish
Clean, smooth, and lingering without the harsh burn often associated with t=
raditional silver tequilas.=C2=A0
=C2=A0

How We Enjoy It

While El Platino makes an exceptional margarita, some of our favorite momen=
ts are the simplest:

- Neat in a rocks glass
- Served slightly chilled
- Paired with fresh seafood
- Enjoyed while watching the sun set on the water
No mixers. No distractions. Just tequila as it was meant to be experienced.
It is this commitment to craftsmanship that helped earn AsomBroso El Platin=
o recognition as a =E2=80=9CTop Tequila=E2=80=9D at the San Francisco World=
 Spirits Competition.
=C2=A0

Experience the Spirit of Pure Agave

Whether you=E2=80=99re relaxing after a day on the water, gathering with fr=
iends, or simply taking a moment to slow down, El Platino Silver offers an =
authentic expression of agave that rewards those who take the time to savor=
 it.
=C2=A0
=E2=80=9CGreat tequila doesn=E2=80=99t need to be hidden behind mixers. Som=
etimes the purest expression is the most memorable.=E2=80=9D
=C2=A0
