Recap: Practical Tips for Supporting Summer Commuting
Thank you for registering for goDCgo’s webinar on supporting summer commuting for employees. We hope the presentation helped you understand how to maximize your commuter benefits and stay informed, prepared, and connected throughout the season. If you were unable to attend the webinar or need additional resources, you can review the presented materials below:
* Presentation Slides (https://mcusercontent.com/e9ace804f4a957d3c2a85f1c6/files/c90ee07f-c09f-610e-5405-aee4c744fd2d/Summer_Commuting_.pdf)
* Webinar Recording (https://youtu.be/2fQJopVslo4)
* Resources:
+ ETC Tooklit (https://godcgo.com/wp-content/uploads/ETC-Toolkit.pdf)
+ Employee Vendor List (https://godcgo.com/wp-content/uploads/Employer-Vendor-List.pdf)
* Alerts
+ WMATA Alerts & Advisories  (https://www.wmata.com/ride/alerts-and-advisories.html?dateRangeStart=2026-06-04)
+ Alerts DC (https://hsema.dc.gov/alerts)
* Capital Bikeshare
+ Corporate Programs (https://capitalbikeshare.com/corporate)
+ Corporate Program Enrollment Form (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1pNcmNGlEN6wMdjDCXpEue2jC0I0H5TJY0xw0Zj27580/viewform?edit_requested=true)
* CommuterCash App (Apple App Store (https://apps.apple.com/us/app/commutercash/id6670409781)  | Google Play (https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mwcog.commutercash&hl=en_US) )
* Guaranteed Ride Home (https://www.commuterconnections.org/programs-and-incentives/guaranteed-ride-home/)
* goDCgo  (https://godcgo.com/transportation-allstars/#employers) Transportation All-Stars (https://godcgo.com/transportation-allstars/#employers)

Need more assistance understanding which options work best for you?
Schedule a complimentary consultation with our Employer Services team.

