https://shop.asombrosotequila.com/products/especial-de-rouge-and-el-carbonzado-set-750ml

 

 FATHER’S DAY BARREL SELECT EXTRA AÑEJO SET

 

The Ultimate Father’s Day Gift for the Tequila Collector

Celebrate Father’s Day with a curated selection of our most sought-after Extra Añejo tequilas at a special limited-time price.

Included in the Set:

- Gran Reserva 5 Year Extra Añejo – 750ml
- Especial De Rouge 10 Year Extra Añejo – 750ml
- El Carbonzado 6 Year Extra Añejo – 50ml Taster
- Free Shipping right to your door

Retail Value: $714.97
Father’s Day Special: $429.95

---------------------------------------------------------------

ESPECIAL DE ROUGE 10 Year Extra Añejo

(Red Bottle)
80 Proof | ABV 40%
A true showcase of the AsomBroso legacy, Especial De Rouge is aged for an extraordinary 10 years in fine French oak barrels previously used to age Grand Marnier Cognac. Over the course of a decade, the tequila develops remarkable depth, elegance, and complexity, resulting in one of the smoothest sipping tequilas available today.

Taste Profile

Sweet aromas of orange blossom, cooked agave, and French oak lead into a velvety medium-bodied palate with refined notes of citrus, caramelized agave, and a long smooth finish.

---------------------------------------------------------------

GRAN RESERVA 5 Year Extra Añejo

(Black Bottle)
80 Proof | ABV 40%
Our award-winning Gran Reserva begins as 100% Blue Weber Agave Silver tequila before aging five full years in new French oak barrels. The result is an exceptionally rich and refined Extra Añejo often compared to aged Cognac or Armagnac.
For the ultimate tasting experience, we recommend serving in a snifter glass.

Taste Profile

A beautifully layered nose of honey, vanilla, buttercream, and toffee opens into a smooth caramel finish with remarkable balance and depth.

Awards

- “Best of the Best” — Robb Report
- Top Tequila — World Spirits Competition
---------------------------------------------------------------

EL CARBONZADO 6 Year Extra Añejo

(50ml Tasting Bottle Included)
80 Proof | ABV 40%
El Carbonzado is aged for six years — five years in new French oak barrels followed by one additional year in Irish whiskey barrels, creating a uniquely rich and smoky character.

Limited quantities available while inventory lasts.

[Buy Now](https://shop.asombrosotequila.com/products/especial-de-rouge-and-el-carbonzado-set-750ml)

 

 

