Sign in to view your Office 365 E3 invoice
==========================================

Your Office 365 E3 invoice is now available in the Microsoft 365 admin center. Sign in to view it.

View your invoice >>
https://admin.microsoft.com/Adminportal/Home?ref=billoverview/invoice-list&source=tcemail

If you’ve already paid, disregard this email.

If you’re set up to pay by credit card, no action is required—we’ll charge your card within 24 hours of the invoice date.

To review changes made to this subscription, go to the subscription history in the Microsoft 365 admin center.
https://admin.microsoft.com/Adminportal/home?showActivityLog=true&source=tcemail#/subscriptions/webdirect/a8e35c36-9645-4808-a048-14e8f99c4974

