Dear Advertiser,

On July 6, we will update the Local Services platform policies  
<https://c.gle/AOPyDKT7NLWOonl3-x6Wox2tLyXvYhBAPsDTOQUaDBaEo_qDZml9nOaIGct1-5c3xQ3mu5VTtHGT6KQtvFhmgUSIg2juTc45Hngui89rw08L-9xV9oLSe2auGYPjPBnGzPGawef_TRQgxrwUYa5wFjjFpyfw0HwUtYBRmfCtdWWNyUHA8zoOWjQY3YqnODUyu1ZmoC_m-mL2oEo>  
to update terminology, enhance readability, and remove policies that no  
longer apply to Local Services advertisers.

This update builds on the recent change to the Local Services Ads Google  
Guarantee Badges  
<https://c.gle/AOPyDKRjSlNSMAiDGNgJ8Aiku8xBCbBValnyIdNSGR6UIMwaBg5HcHr2lEJo7TiK8nn-02YKsJKYIHxeRMjaiWEeWQtr-3yU5W6-ntoAUPdmV7NwtxnW3up57HPdfFAXge5o693_Vn6OK3dcYhwqYtnKrn8DrSjqasSL6KL_sFyW5idgQ3ewywla1amr5oQbR-J7gp0E8Fm9kcpbvtxVy7igA_jchc7TneFN-vCCu0YbLlbn09ZESA2TQb0SVQmpcJ8NpG60YeLKs6IcNBHdth-ln-sMO97SsnhTUSsgYRw_nkHG9NGATRMmUG_PmQOsM_wmnqR_Wyv5831bwefHjSk>  
and aligns the policies with the new badge system.

With this update, we’re also renaming the Local Services platform policies  
<https://c.gle/AOPyDKRglVaqd6rF_hWQMGeiNEPaLHrN9F-G7uLCaP2p0JP7YQy32m943B0E2Eha4YnvOlH_Fxt8uAk5o7pwE1Dg1pLUvG-Bbov-JQ2y3qtB7M4oWQCHHwJeSSC1AgLFZK_etlJc0B4O8vdsxtctCCFpCBQ8Ev1fCYxiD3bjnRwV9YNI7k4G3LX5AeOlKHhxO7K1kVmAaIyNAPU>  
as “Local Services Ads requirements”.

Thank you for your cooperation.

Sincerely,

The Google Ads Team

(c) 2026 Google LLC 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043

