Most people tell you that to start a business, you need a degree.

A 4-year degree. **£27,000 in student loans.** A piece of paper that may or may not get you the job your subject prepared you for.

That's NOT where a business starts David.

A business starts with a **FEELING**.

An instinct that you've got something to offer that no one else does. That you're tired of working for someone else's dream while yours quietly dies in a Google Doc somewhere.

The education system was supposed to give you the tools. It didn't. It gave you debt.

But the world changed.

You used to need a developer team to make software. Now you describe what you want in plain English and software exists. You used to need a marketing degree to write a sales page. Now you brief a tool and it writes the sales page. You used to need £27,000 and 4 years to start.

**Now you need 5 weeks and a working internet connection.**

We're here to give you the knowledge that the education system kept from you. The keys to being **FREE**. Working for yourself. Controlling your own destiny.

And we're giving it to you for **FREE.**

**Your next step:** click below and sign up to [_The HelpBnk AI Accelerator_](https://www.simonsquibb.com/ai-accelerator-helpbnk)[.](https://www.simonsquibb.com/ai-accelerator-helpbnk)

A **FREE 5-week** _doing_ program. Starts Saturday 13 June. And the three best businesses at the end split a **$3,000 prize.**

👉[_[Claim My FREE Spot]_](https://www.simonsquibb.com/ai-accelerator-helpbnk)

-HelpBnk

**P.S. -** We are not telling you to quit your job. We are telling you to stop assuming the next 4 years have to look like the last 4.


———

